use them anymore.

My Pokémon always goes out
to have fun without me.{VAR BE01}
I wonder where it gets that attitude?

My work keeps me very busy, and I only
go home once a week or so.{VAR BE01}
I'm sorry to leave my wife lonely, but
that's the life of a powerful executive.{VAR BE01}
Oh, this is a souvenir from a business
trip, but she does not seem to need it,{VAR BE00}
